# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession gathering build` from tools/lib/professions/routes/skinning.json and data/forever. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/skinning
title Skinning 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth

# Skinning takes leather and hides from the beasts you kill. Leatherworking turns them into armour, so
# the two go well together.
#
# Ranks: Apprentice at any level; Journeyman from skill 50, Expert from 125 and Artisan from 200, at
# the trainers in the capitals and the larger towns. The trainers in the starting areas teach only up
# to 75. On Zephras Isle the quest Harvesting Windstones offers Pelt Collecting for Beginners, which
# teaches Skinning.
#
# A beast needs Skinning skill 1 up to level 10, 10 more for every level from 11 to 19 (level 15 needs
# 50), and five times its level from 20 (level 30 needs 150). Enchant Gloves - Skinning lets you skin
# beasts a level higher; Horde players can take the Keen Skinning Knife (+3) from Unwelcome Guests in
# The Barrens.
#
# Each gathering step offers areas to roam with the most of what the skill can gather (the server's
# own spawns, how often each is up, and what players' recorded gathers gave): the window lists those
# for your level, best first, the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it, never
# among creatures two or more levels above you, and away from the other faction's towns and guards.
# Waypoints are Era-frame; a map without one (Zephras Isle) compiles live.

section Skinning 1-75

step Learn Skinning
  tip No character level needed. On Zephras Isle, Pelt Collecting for Beginners from Harvesting Windstones teaches it too.
  train Skinning Apprentice

step Buy a Skinning Knife
  tip A tool: it stays in your bags, and every corpse needs it.
  buy 7005 x1 nearest

step Skin beasts of level 1-10 until 50
  tip Loot each beast, then skin it. Starting-area beasts give points all the way to 75.
